        "answer": {
          "short": "$x=\\dfrac{-1\\pm\\sqrt{22}}{3}$",
          "worked": "Here $a=3$, $b=2$, $c=-7$.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}b^2-4ac&=2^2-4(3)(-7)\\\\b^2-4ac&=88\\\\x&=\\frac{-2\\pm\\sqrt{88}}{2(3)}\\\\x&=\\frac{-2\\pm2\\sqrt{22}}{6}\\\\x&=\\frac{-1\\pm\\sqrt{22}}{3}\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 60
